      "text": "Other factors to consider:\n1. API Gateway: 5ms\n2. Feature retrieval: 20ms\n3. Preprocessing: 5 ms\n4. Model inference: 100ms\n5. Postprocessing: 5ms\n6. Network: 5ms\n\nTotal: 140ms",
