    {
      "id": "_3nUd-PFVILGdFZ8bj3iy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2068.430938720703,
      "y": -54.0517578125,
      "width": 1067.119384765625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1014070868,
      "version": 1196,
      "versionNonce": 1830303084,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786297937527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ii) each pod may take 15 sec to start, means by the time new pods are ready\n   old pods will be already overloaded.\n\n    Other questions to answer:\n    > on what basis we'll increase the pod?\n    > how many pods we need to add?\n    > Meanwhile we're scaling or pods are busy, how many requests to put in queue?\n         Because if queue wait is already more than SLA, then no point in having request in queue.\n         hence, \n            how much queue bound?\n            how much timeout?\n            backpressure?\n    > even if auto-scaling brings down p99, we still had period of unacceptable latency, what to do about it? \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ii) each pod may take 15 sec to start, means by the time new pods are ready\n   old pods will be already overloaded.\n\n    Other questions to answer:\n    > on what basis we'll increase the pod?\n    > how many pods we need to add?\n    > Meanwhile we're scaling or pods are busy, how many requests to put in queue?\n         Because if queue wait is already more than SLA, then no point in having request in queue.\n         hence, \n            how much queue bound?\n            how much timeout?\n            backpressure?\n    > even if auto-scaling brings down p99, we still had period of unacceptable latency, what to do about it? \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
