    {
      "id": "XnMd7oVgdAYdEpagEXT0A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2112.3913317483566,
      "y": 438.24110243055543,
      "width": 702.4396362304688,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 192935276,
      "version": 826,
      "versionNonce": 1531810412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786298490268,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how many pods we need to add?\nBefore production we measure each pod capacity:\n\n1 pod -> 500 QPS @ 50ms p99 means 1000 QPS -> 2 pods @ 52ms p99\nso we may say 20,000/500 -> 40 pods\nBut, we also consider utilization say 70%\nso: 40/0.7 ~ 57 pods is what we need",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how many pods we need to add?\nBefore production we measure each pod capacity:\n\n1 pod -> 500 QPS @ 50ms p99 means 1000 QPS -> 2 pods @ 52ms p99\nso we may say 20,000/500 -> 40 pods\nBut, we also consider utilization say 70%\nso: 40/0.7 ~ 57 pods is what we need",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
