      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VgDNSPsWkmRC3t01XddgD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2113.432035757452,
      "y": 1082.4364781498507,
      "width": 484.7796630859375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2039379948,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 486029548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786300482519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "period of unacceptable latency\n1. over-provision capacity, don't work on 80-90%.\n2. Pre-scaling: if traffic predictable.\n3. fast autoscaling, check of early scaling signals.\n4. bounded queue, absorb a small burst.\n5. back-pressure, of fallback.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "period of unacceptable latency\n1. over-provision capacity, don't work on 80-90%.\n2. Pre-scaling: if traffic predictable.\n3. fast autoscaling, check of early scaling signals.\n4. bounded queue, absorb a small burst.\n5. back-pressure, of fallback.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
