      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786353610838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Multimodal Serving",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Multimodal Serving",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "844o8dG_qlSWFK-mElnsU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 639.3853918273708,
      "y": 1680.5874635248574,
      "width": 761.939453125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1973012308,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 1209876436,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786354411181,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Should we host multiple models in a single service or every model as a service. \n\nWe need to think first, let's see pros and cons:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Should we host multiple models in a single service or every model as a service. \n\nWe need to think first, let's see pros and cons:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xm-S0wvmcAm4ys0CoIRA8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 652.4263363177755,
      "y": 1797.1409049078497,
      "width": 437.39971923828125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1750851668,
      "version": 296,
      "versionNonce": 924594004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786354900112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Multiple models in single service\n\nPros:\n1. Better resource utilisation\n2. Easy monitoring & management\n3. Fast model loading\n\nCons:\n1. Noisy Neighbour\n2. Can't scale independently\n3. Deployment can cause downtime to others\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Multiple models in single service\n\nPros:\n1. Better resource utilisation\n2. Easy monitoring & management\n3. Fast model loading\n\nCons:\n1. Noisy Neighbour\n2. Can't scale independently\n3. Deployment can cause downtime to others\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YlqYiThmG8ruAYQABfSCs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1350.4046459915016,
      "y": 1796.7611128701615,
      "width": 322.9598388671875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1127198932,
      "version": 379,
      "versionNonce": 1184382932,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786354843720,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each models as separate service\n\nPros:\n1. Resource Isolation\n        No noisy neighbour problem\n2. Independent Scaling\n3. Independent Deployment\n\nCons:\n1. Resource wastage\n2. Operational complexity",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each models as separate service\n\nPros:\n1. Resource Isolation\n        No noisy neighbour problem\n2. Independent Scaling\n3. Independent Deployment\n\nCons:\n1. Resource wastage\n2. Operational complexity",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xtPlnEdcMLrvsHdk7lb9I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 646.3197612365752,
      "y": 2124.807370526622,
      "width": 897.1793212890625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2016870356,
      "version": 480,
      "versionNonce": 774046548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786355094906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But most of the times we go with hybrid approach, once we answer the following questions:\n\n1. Case 1: Same traffic pattern & SLA  \n\n2. Case 2: Different resource requirements, one GPU model one CPU model \n\n3. Case 3: Different Criticality, loan approval p99 <100ms, recommendation p99 < 500ms ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But most of the times we go with hybrid approach, once we answer the following questions:\n\n1. Case 1: Same traffic pattern & SLA  \n\n2. Case 2: Different resource requirements, one GPU model one CPU model \n\n3. Case 3: Different Criticality, loan approval p99 <100ms, recommendation p99 < 500ms ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
