      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 25055572,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 82487788,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786371692143,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But still how do we meet 100ms SLA?\n\n> Break the latency budget.\n> Understand you can not calculate everything on the fly, pre-calculate ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But still how do we meet 100ms SLA?\n\n> Break the latency budget.\n> Understand you can not calculate everything on the fly, pre-calculate ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Z6B-KI5xluIEAf_oDrw7E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3553.0660813076083,
      "y": 1098.3999729576285,
      "width": 920.9793701171875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 331371500,
      "version": 546,
      "versionNonce": 1268641748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "DUzQ5Nm5Bp827NSflkKu_",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786372403595,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to handle late events?\n\ntransaction happened: 10:00 AM\narrived late due to network delay at 10:05 AM\n\nUse Event Time, not processing time\"\n\nProcessing Time is when my system processed this event: say Kafka processed it at 10:05 AM\nEvent Time is when this event happened which is 10:00 AM, Flink uses event time\n\nNow events can arrive late so for how long we must wait",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to handle late events?\n\ntransaction happened: 10:00 AM\narrived late due to network delay at 10:05 AM\n\nUse Event Time, not processing time\"\n\nProcessing Time is when my system processed this event: say Kafka processed it at 10:05 AM\nEvent Time is when this event happened which is 10:00 AM, Flink uses event time\n\nNow events can arrive late so for how long we must wait",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
